Short:        Example of how to use chunky AGA copper displays with 2D rotation demo
Author:       Ranulf Doswell (1 Ayr Street, Lancaster, Lancashire, England, LA1 3DT)
Uploader:     cstaebi csv warwick ac uk (Ranulf Doswell) account vanishes soon
Type:         dev/src
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This demo includes assembler source for the rotation demo. It can easily
manage 50fps with nearly full screen on a base 1200, and 25fps on full screen.
It may well do 50fps on a 4000, but I'm not sure.
